  "critical_guards": [
    "Election outcome is not a law and is not proof of election causality",
    "A nonbinding advisory vote never auto-creates a zoning prohibition",
    "A state bill introduced is not an enacted or in-force law",
    "Signed and effective dates must be separate; unknown effective_on is null",
    "Local project grandfathering, judicial review and regional authority are not assumed",
    "Regulatory action can facilitate, condition, delay or block capacity, not always reduce it",
    "Approved/announced/constructed/energized/installed/training-ready are distinct project states",
    "Primary legal text vs government announcement vs legislative tracker vs election counting must retain source rank",
    "A national policy action plan is not automatically a locally binding construction permit ban",
    "A law's presence does not establish causal delay, investment relocation or its desirability",
    "Source vintage and first FSL capture are separate; no future hindsight leak",
    "US/EU/CN sources cannot be normalized into a single law-restrictiveness score",
    "Legal operability does not imply systemic AI singularity or civilizational net gain"
  ],
